<title>USA: Golf Trust closes $100 mln loan facility.</title>
<headline>Golf Trust closes $100 mln loan facility.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLESTON, S.C. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Golf Trust of America Inc said Monday that its operating partnership, Golf Trust of America LP, closed a two-year, $100 million secured revolving credit facility with a group of four commercial banks led by NationsBank Corp.</p>
<p>The company said the line of credit will be used for further acquisitions of upscale golf courses.</p>
<p>Golf Trust of America is a self-advised real estate investment trust specializing in the ownership of such golf courses. It has interests in 10 U.S. courses.</p>
</text>
